  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum模组。充满爱意打造。为Fabric、Forge和Neo提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">随机生物效果（Random Mob Effects）是一个可配置的模组，旨在让游戏难度略微提升。每当敌对生物加入世界时，它们都会获得一个随机的药水效果。默认情况下禁用了少数几种药水效果，但在首次加载时会生成一个黑名单，您可以修改其中的数值。应用的效果持续时间为Java中的最大整数值，即2147483647刻；相当于游戏内约30000小时。粒子效果可以禁用。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>potionEffectLevel</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1，最小值 1，最大值 50</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模组应用的药水效果的默认等级，默认为1。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideEffectParticles</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，隐藏带有药水效果的生物的粒子特效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>disableCreepers</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">苦力怕可能会产生无限的滞留药水效果，这通常不是您想要的结果。启用此选项后，模组不会给苦力怕赋予随机效果。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>默认黑名单</strong></span><br>在模组首次加载时生成。它会遍历Forge注册表中的所有药水效果。这意味着支持模组添加的效果，只需在添加了新效果模组的刷新配置即可。<em>您可以在效果名称前加上感叹号（!）来禁用该效果。</em><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黑名单文件位于<em><strong>./config/randommobeffects/</strong></em>目录下，名为<em><strong>blacklist.txt</strong></em>。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-mob-effects/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1081\" height=\"948\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">带有随机效果的敌对生物：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-mob-effects/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-mob-effects/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"510\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源保持在CurseForge或Modrinth生态系统内，您可以自由地将本模组用于任何整合包中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在这么多独立的模组页面中追踪评论，因此评论区已关闭。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他内容，请访问<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
